  "worked_solution": "For two segments to be congruent, they must have the same length.\n\nSo, let's determine the length of each segment in the diagram. We see that:\n\n- $AB=AC=4$ units\n\n- $DE=5$ units\n\n- $FG=6$ units\n\nTherefore, the only pair of congruent segments is $\\overset{―}{AB}$ and $\\overset{―}{AC}.$",
